.TH "libnvme" 9 "enum nvme_lm_tact" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
enum nvme_lm_tact \- Track Send - Track Memory Changes - Management Operation Specific field - Tracking Action (TACT)
.SH SYNOPSIS
enum nvme_lm_tact {
.br
.BI "    NVME_LM_TACT_STOP_TRACKING"
, 
.br
.br
.BI "    NVME_LM_TACT_START_TRACKING"

};
.SH Constants
.IP "NVME_LM_TACT_STOP_TRACKING" 12
Stop tracking host memory changes
.IP "NVME_LM_TACT_START_TRACKING" 12
Start tracking host memory changes; the
data buffer contains a Track Memory Changes data
structure, see \fIstruct nvme_lm_track_memory_changes_data\fP
